  "description": "The Grange is a well-established development of apartments based in Stillorgan, South Dublin. The scheme boasts exquisite modern finishes throughout and a wealth of resident amenities on site. Located just 8km from the city centre, the QBC bus corridor is right on your doorstep and the Sandyford LUAS stop is within a 15-minute walk. We’re conveniently located close to the N11 and M50 motorway, the Leopardstown Inn and neighbourhood shops are located a 5-minute walk away and you’ll have access to Leopardstown Park located right next door.\n\nOur two-bedroom apartments are beautifully designed with ultra-modern premium finishes and a minimalist touch, basked in daylight from floor-to-ceiling windows, offering spectacular views of the surrounding area. The kitchen features a sleek handle less design, completed with marble backsplash and countertops. Leading into a contemporary open plan dining and living area, you can enjoy the summer evenings on the balcony, overlooking either the Dublin mountains or Dublin Bay.\n\nFinished to the highest specification, our apartments have the following features:\n\n-\tFloor-to-ceiling windows\n-\tBespoke, high-quality interior finishes\n-\tNewly-furnished with high quality contemporary furniture and fittings by MJF Interiors\n-\tFully-integrated kitchen units with high quality appliances \n-\tSeparate utility room\n-\tPlenty of storage\n-\tWood flooring throughout\n-\tMobile video entry security system\n-\tWiring for phone, cable and super-fast broadband\n-\tEfficient central heating system with App controls",
